@segment 24-26 Darkshore, Ashenvale I & Stonetalon
@start-level 24
# First Kalimdor trip. Carried through untouched: 57, 67, 157, 181, 240, 453 (segment 10) and 275, 295, 471 (segment 9).
# Carry-out adds 1026 (Raene's Cleansing, the rod: segment 12); 94500 goes back to Hervdana with the Full Blue Waterskin.
