# Left out on purpose: 731 and 908 (elite), 1199 / 1198 / 1275 / 1200 / 971 (Blackfathom Deeps), 1072 / 1075 / 1094 (they send
# you to Ironforge, Stormwind or Ratchet), 1057, and the quests kept for segment 12 (1035, 1011/1012, 1021/1031, 1022,
# 4581, 98417/98418, 86757, 1027-1046), the Darnassus hand-ins (1081, 741, 3765).
