# ---------- Auberdine ----------
F Auberdine @ Darkshore, 36.3, 45.6 | Walk off the dock into Auberdine. Caylais Moonfeather, the hippogryph master, stands at the foot of the dock.
T 97894 @ Darkshore, 38.1, 41.2 | Gorbold Steelhand, at a merchant stall in Auberdine: the message from his brother in Stormwind
A 729 | Archaeologist Hollee, the dwarf in the north part of the village
A 965 | Sentinel Elissa Starbreeze, in the building on the east side of the village

# ---------- Tower of Althalaxx ----------
T 965 | Follow the road north out of Auberdine (Ghost Wolf) and turn east where the land rises toward the Tower of Althalaxx. Balthule Shadowstrike hides below the tower (55.0, 24.9).
A 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
C 966 | Dark Strand Fanatics (16-17) camp around the tower: kill them for 4 Worn Parchments. They are far below you. Do not climb the tower: Athrikus Narassin (31) is at the top.
T 966 | Balthule Shadowstrike
A 967 | Balthule Shadowstrike. A letter for Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.

# ---------- South along the road ----------
T 729 | Run back past Auberdine and take the road south (Ghost Wolf), a long way. Near the south end of Darkshore leave the road to the west: Prospector Remtravel stands in his dig (35.7, 83.7). Do not take his escort (elite).
A 945 | Therylune is in the Master's Glaive, the ruin just south-east of the dig (38.6, 87.3). Kill the cultists around her first.
C 945 @ Darkshore, 38.6, 87.3 | Escort: walk with Therylune until she is out of the Master's Glaive. Stay ahead of her and kill what attacks; everything here is far below you.
A 5321 | Go north-east to the Grove of the Ancients, beside the road (44.4, 76.4). Kerlonian Evershade sleeps there.
C 5321 | Take the Horn of Awakening out of Kerlonian's Chest next to him, then escort Kerlonian south along the road. He follows you and keeps falling asleep: use the Horn of Awakening on him each time. Stay on the road and walk (no Ghost Wolf, he cannot keep up). Changed in Forever: the objective now reads "escort Kerlonian on the road south to his bag", still in Darkshore, so the escort part may end before Ashenvale. The hand-in is still listed at Maestra's Post.

# ---------- Maestra's Post ----------
T 5321 | Maestra's Post is the first camp on the road inside Ashenvale. Liladris Moonriver stands at its north end (27.3, 35.6).
T 967 | Delgren the Purifier, in the camp (26.2, 38.7)
A 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 1010 | Orendil Broadleaf, next to him
C 970 @ Ashenvale, 31.3, 30.8 | The Dark Strand cultists dig in the ruins north-east of Maestra's Post (around 31, 31). Kill Cultists, Adepts, Excavators (18-20) and the Enforcer until one drops the Glowing Soul Gem.
C 1010 @ Ashenvale, 31.7, 23.0 | Bathran's Haunt is further north (around 32, 23). Pick 5 Bathran's Hair from the Plant Bundles on the ground between the Forsaken there (18-20).
T 1010 | Back at Maestra's Post: Orendil Broadleaf
A 1020 | Orendil Broadleaf. His cure goes to Astranaar.
T 970 | Delgren the Purifier
A 973 | Delgren the Purifier

# ---------- Shrine of Aessina and Fire Scar Shrine ----------
T 945 | Go south from Maestra's Post, across the road. Therysil stands at the Shrine of Aessina (22.6, 51.9).
C 973 | Fire Scar Shrine is just south of the Shrine of Aessina. Ilkrud Magthrull (24) stands in the middle of it (25.3, 60.7) with Felslayers (22-23) all around. Clear a path of Felslayers one at a time (they drain mana: kill them fast), then fight Ilkrud with full mana: Earth Shock his Shadow Bolts and drop Stoneclaw Totem for whatever he calls. He drops Ilkrud Magthrull's Tome. You hand it in when you pass Maestra's Post again.

# ---------- Astranaar ----------
F Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 34.4, 48.0 | Go back north to the road and follow it east to Astranaar, the town on the island in the lake. Daelyshia, the hippogryph master, stands at the west entrance.
S Astranaar @ Ashenvale, 37.0, 49.2 | Innkeeper Kimlya in the inn
A 1008 | Shindrell Swiftfire, near the west entrance
A 991 | Raene Wolfrunner, in the building in the middle of town
T 1020 | Pelturas Whitemoon, in the house at the south-east end of town
A 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon
C 94500 @ Ashenvale, 34.4, 48.0 | Call of Water: walk down to the lake that surrounds Astranaar and use the Unfilled Blue Waterskin at the water. The quest only says "the waters of Astranaar"; any spot on the shore next to town should do. Keep the Full Blue Waterskin: it goes back to Hervdana in the Wetlands in segment 9.

# ---------- Lake Falathim and the Zoram Strand ----------
T 991 | Take the road west out of Astranaar and leave it to the north-west for Lake Falathim. Teronis' Corpse lies at the lake (20.3, 42.3).
A 1023 | From Teronis' Corpse
C 1023 | Saltspittle murlocs (19-21) around the lake: kill them until one drops the Glowing Gem.
A 1007 | Keep north-west to the coast. Talen camps above the Zoram Strand (14.8, 31.3). The Horde has a camp on the shore south-west of him (Classic knowledge, not checked for Forever): stay away from its guards.
C 1007 | The Ancient Statuette lies on the strand north of Talen (14.2, 20.6). Fight your way there through the Wrathtail naga and count their heads.
T 1007 | Talen
A 1009 | Talen
C 1009,1008 @ Ashenvale, 9.0, 18.0 | Kill naga along the strand until you have 20 Wrathtail Heads: Wave Riders and Sorceresses (18-19) on the near side, Razortails and Sea Witches (19-20) further out, Myrmidons and Priestesses (20-21) at the north end. Ruuzel (22) stands with her guards on the small island at the north end (7.2, 13.1): pull the guards one at a time with a shock from maximum range, then kill her for the Ring of Zoram. Earth Shock the casters' heals and lightning. Lady Vespia, a rare elite who walks the strand, also carries the ring: leave her unless she is alone and you are at full health.
T 1009 | Talen

# ---------- Maestra's Post again ----------
T 973 | Walk back east to Maestra's Post: Delgren the Purifier
A 976 | Feero Ironhand, standing next to Delgren. This starts an escort with three ambushes.
C 976 @ Ashenvale, 26.2, 38.9 | Walk with Feero. Three groups attack one after the other, the last one the strongest. Eat and drink to full before you talk to him, drop Stoneclaw Totem at the start of each ambush, kill the casters first with Earth Shock on their casts, and heal between waves. Feero fights too, but he must survive.
T 976 | Delgren the Purifier at Maestra's Post

# ---------- Astranaar hand-ins ----------
T 1008 | Back along the road to Astranaar: Shindrell Swiftfire
A 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire. The wyverns are in Stonetalon, later in this segment.
T 1023 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1024,1025,1054 | Raene Wolfrunner
A 1070 | Sentinel Thenysil, on the west side of town
A 1056 | Faldreas Goeth'Shael, near Raene's building

# ---------- North and east of Astranaar ----------
C 1054 | Thistlefur Village is in the hills north of Astranaar. Dal Bloodclaw (25) stands at 37.7, 34.7 among Thistlefur furbolgs (23-24), many of them Shamans who heal. Pull single furbolgs on the way in, Earth Shock every heal, and take Dal with full mana and Stoneclaw Totem down. Loot his skull.
C 1033 | Come back down to the road and follow it east to Iris Lake, north of the road. Elune's Tear lies on the small island in the lake (46.4, 46.4): pick one up.
T 1024 | Shael'dryn stands at the moonwell further east, north of the road (53.5, 46.2)
A 1026 | Shael'dryn. Keep this one: the rod pieces are for the second Ashenvale trip (segment 12).
T 1054 | Back to Astranaar: Raene Wolfrunner
T 1033 | Pelturas Whitemoon
A 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon

# ---------- South of Astranaar: Stardust, Silverwind Refuge ----------
C 1034 | Leave Astranaar and go south. The Ruins of Stardust are on the island in the lake south of town (33.3, 67.8): pick 5 Handfuls of Stardust from the Stardust Covered Bushes.
A 1016 | Go east along the south side of the zone, past the mouth of the Talondeep Path, to Silverwind Refuge on the shore of Mystral Lake. Sentinel Velene Starstrike is there (49.8, 67.2).
C 1016 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Befouled Water Elementals (23-25) walk in and around Mystral Lake. Kill them for 5 Intact Elemental Bracers, then right-click the Divining Scroll she gave you to make the Divined Scroll.
T 1016 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
C 1025 @ Ashenvale, 53.3, 62.0 | The Foulweald furbolgs live in Greenpaw Village, north-east of Silverwind Refuge (49-58, 60-65). Kill 1 Den Watcher, 2 Ursas (both 24-25, in the middle of the village), 10 Totemics and 12 Warriors (23-24). Earth Shock the Totemics before they heal, kill their totems, and pull from the edge so you fight two at most.
C 1017 @ Ashenvale, 49.0, 70.4 | Sarilus Foulborne (25) stands on the island in the middle of Mystral Lake. Clear the elementals near the island, then fight him with full mana: Earth Shock his casts, and drop Stoneclaw Totem if he has a summoned servant with him. Loot his head. (Questie files him under a Barrens map position; the lake is where the quest sends you.)
T 1017 | Sentinel Velene Starstrike
A 98027 | Only if you are level 25, otherwise press Skip here and on its hand-in. A Gleaming Crescent Pendant lies on the ground east of Mystral Lake (63.0, 71.5): clicking it starts a level 29 quest (new in Forever). The woods out there are above your level: go in Ghost Wolf, take the pendant and leave.

# ---------- Talondeep Path -> Windshear Crag ----------
T 1070 | Go back west to the Talondeep Path, the tunnel in the southern cliffs (entrance at Ashenvale 42.3, 71.0), and run through it into the Stonetalon Mountains. You come out in Windshear Crag. Kaela Shadowspear watches the valley from its south-west side (59.9, 66.8).
A 1085 | Kaela Shadowspear
T 1085 | Gaxim Rustfizzle, a few steps from her
A 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle
A 1093 | Ziz Fizziks, in the small hut a little north (59.0, 62.6)
C 1071,1093 | The Venture Co. camps fill Windshear Crag north-east of here. Kill 10 Loggers (18-19) and 10 Deforesters (19-20), and Operators (19-20, around the machines) until one drops the Super Reaper 6000 Blueprints.
A 1090 | Piznik stands at the back of the Windshear Mine, the kobold mine in the south-east wall of the crag (71.9, 60.0). Kill the Windshear kobolds (20-22) on the way in.
C 1090 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 71.9, 60.0 | Piznik starts mining and kobolds attack in waves until he is done. Stand at the tunnel in front of him, drop Stoneclaw Totem when a wave arrives and Earthbind Totem to keep them together, and heal between waves. He must survive.
T 1090 | Piznik
A 1092 | Piznik
T 1092,1093 | Ziz Fizziks. Do not take Further Instructions (it sends you to Ratchet).
T 1071 | Gaxim Rustfizzle. Do not take An Old Colleague (it sends you to Ironforge and Stormwind).

# ---------- Mirkfallon Lake and Stonetalon Peak ----------
A 86574 | Follow the road west and then north through the mountains to Mirkfallon Lake. On the way it passes below Sun Rock Retreat, a Horde town (Classic knowledge): stay on the road in Ghost Wolf and do not go up the side path. The body of the Night Elf Courier lies at the lake (48.6, 39.8): Stonetalon Supply Run (new in Forever).
C 86574,1134 @ Stonetalon Mountains, 50.6, 43.0 | Pridewing wyverns fly all around Mirkfallon Lake: Wyverns (21-22), Consorts (22-23) and Skyhunters (23-24). Kill them for 12 Pridewing Venom Sacs and 6 Stonetalon Supply Bundles (the new quest's bundles come from the same wyverns). Stoneform removes their poison. Leave the Pridewing Patriarch (25, rare elite) alone.
T 86574 | Take the road north from the lake up to Stonetalon Peak. Innkeeper Faralia is in the inn (35.7, 5.8).
T 1056 | Keeper Albagorm, the big Keeper of the Grove on the hill (37.1, 8.1). Do not take his follow-up.
F Stonetalon Peak @ Stonetalon Mountains, 36.4, 7.2 | Teloren, the hippogryph master

# ---------- Back to Astranaar and the boat ----------
FLY Astranaar | Teloren. If the flight is not offered, use your hearthstone: it is bound in Astranaar.
T 1134 | Shindrell Swiftfire
T 1025 | Raene Wolfrunner
T 1034 | Pelturas Whitemoon
T 98027 | Maliynn, in the building next to Raene (36.6, 49.9). Press Skip if you never picked up the pendant.
FLY Auberdine | Daelyshia, at the west entrance of Astranaar
N Take the boat from Auberdine to Menethil Harbor | Check on the dock which boat it is: one pier goes to Menethil Harbor, the other to Darnassus. The Full Blue Waterskin and Raene's Cleansing stay in your log.
